                                    by <span class="parent-category-article-author" onclick="window.open('/authors/juanzili')">Brian O'Neill</span>
                                        <span class="disable-select icon-core">
                                          <img width="18" height="18" alt="DZone Core" src="https://dz2cdn1.dzone.com/themes/dz20/images/dz-core-icon.png" style="margin: 0 0 3px 5px; filter: brightness(0) invert(1);" />
                                          CORE
