                                <div class="parent-category-article">
                                  <p class="parent-category-article-title">
                                    <a href="/articles/dynamic-multi-hierarchy-security-model">Designing a Dynamic Multi-Hierarchy Security Model for Analytics and Decision Support Systems</a>
                                  </p>
                                  <p class="parent-category-article-details">
                                    <span class="parent-category-article-date">August 31, 2026</span>
